[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お話の通りだと、この後助けが来るはずだけど……\nレスナちゃんたちなら、きっと大丈夫だよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "According to the story, help should come after this... I'm sure Resna and the others will be okay."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うぅ……やっぱり怖いよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... I'm still scared though."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃぁっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "無事なようで何よりだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm glad to see you're safe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ス、ステルクさん！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "S-Sterk?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なかなか戻ってこない君たちを心配した\nリヒャルト殿下から、後を追うよう命が下ったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Prince Richard was worried when you didn't return and ordered me to follow after you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こうして来てみれば、君が攫われたと聞いた。\n村の人たちから情報を集めてここまで来たんだが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When I arrived, I heard you'd been kidnapped. I gathered information from the villagers and made my way here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "遅くなってすまない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry I'm late."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いっ！\u3000いえいえっ！\n怖かったけど、襲われたりしませんでしたし！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no, not at all! I was scared, but I wasn't attacked or anything!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だが姫を護るのは騎士の務め",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But protecting the princess is a knight's duty."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっと……わたしはお姫様役に決まっただけですよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... this is just roleplay, you know?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "トトリ君たちから聞いた。私が騎士にと\n名乗りを上げた以上、理由は十分なはずだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard from Totori and the others. Since I've taken on the role of knight, that should be reason enough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姫。君を守ってみせよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Princess, I shall protect you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃ、よろしくお願いしますね！\nえっと……騎士様？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then, please take care of me! Um... Sir Knight?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ステルクさんって、案外ノリがいいのよねぇ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk's surprisingly good at playing along..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁ二人とも楽しそうだし、いいんじゃないかな。\n……さて、騎士様",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, they both seem to be having fun, so I guess it's fine. ...Now then, Sir Knight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロロナ姫の身の安全も確保したことだし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now that Princess Rorona's safety is secured..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。いざ魔物の親玉を退治せん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Let us go forth and defeat the monster leader."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]